            "response": "Thank you so much for the wonderful review! We’re thrilled to hear your family had such an incredible time and that the location, amenities, and convenience made everything so enjoyable—especially with little ones in tow! It’s great to know the house had everything you needed and that the nearby pool, soccer field, and golf cart made your stay even better. We’d absolutely love to welcome you back anytime!",
